  "title": "Spicy Tuna Fish Cakes",
  "description": "These spicy tuna fish cakes are made with canned tuna, dried spices, onion, and a mashed potato for a binder. They fry up into deliciously crisp patties!",
  "authors": [
    "Raquel Teixeira"
  ],
